### Create a new enrollment
POST https://localhost:5001/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "S001",
  "courseCode": "CS-101"
}

### Get all enrollments
GET https://localhost:5001/api/enrollments

### Get an enrollment by ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}

### Delete an enrollment
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}

### Example response for POST /api/enrollments
# Expected response body
{
  "id": "a1b2c3d4",
  "studentId": "S001",
  "courseCode": "CS-101",
  "enrolledAt": "2026-06-25T12:34:56Z"
}
